gn: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/fab16a9dd67f5855166de7b5986047e8.avif?t=1787673383\" width=600 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/9d14aa0b8615a9f6cdf47b7ce452f931.webp?t=1787673383\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/40029d028e3d7f61b82f15c090470b81.poster.avif?t=1787673383\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/40029d028e3d7f61b82f15c090470b81.webm?t=1787673383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/40029d028e3d7f61b82f15c090470b81.mp4?t=1787673383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/07628a7ab2838cfd8c49eee4031a73ce.poster.avif?t=1787673383\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/07628a7ab2838cfd8c49eee4031a73ce.webm?t=1787673383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/07628a7ab2838cfd8c49eee4031a73ce.mp4?t=1787673383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/fc2c1a2b18ee2ece4489431ace1686ea.poster.avif?t=1787673383\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/fc2c1a2b18ee2ece4489431ace1686ea.webm?t=1787673383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/fc2c1a2b18ee2ece4489431ace1686ea.mp4?t=1787673383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/629196b00536543c9b63e10834e5c173.webp?t=1787673383\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No AI Generated Slop!!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A full Campaign</strong> with over 10 tasty food-themed levels. Battle through a tower made of pizza, mountains of spaghetti and meatballs, forests made of candy, an intergalactic pizza mothership, mysterious ancient pizza ruin and pyramids, and much more! (plus dedicated boss arenas)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14+  Souls-like bosses</strong> with unique move sets, multiple phases, and delicious food themed arenas that will keep you on your toes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush Mode</strong> – face every boss in a back-to-back gauntlet and prove you’ve truly mastered them all. Centered around a points system where you can purchase anything but only have a limited amount of points. You earn more points for each boss defeated letting you save and purchase better gear, upgrades, etc. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sugar Free Mode</strong> – freely replay any level or boss whenever you want, perfect for practice or messing around with friends, or just trying out different weapons and gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-Based Survival</strong> – Classic hold out against endless escalating hordes of snacks to see how many waves you can survive, or attempt the story/easter egg quests lurking in the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shrinking Zone Survival</strong> – battle inside a dynamic, ever-tightening safe zone that keeps you moving in between waves. (Think wave based survival but with a battle royale zone forcing you around a large level, all leading to an epic finale boss fight)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Side-Scroller Platformer</strong> levels packed with deadly obstacles and pure skill-based platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full 3D Space Combat</strong> – hop into fighter ships for free-flight dogfights and explosive space battles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ outrageously varied weapons</strong> (each with killer upgrades), enchanted gummy gauntlets, a freeze ray that can freeze enemies solid and then shatter them into pieces, crystal rayguns that vaporize entire waves in seconds, and even elemental pizza shotguns!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Online Coop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless 1st/3rd person camera switching</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple difficulty settings</strong> – from chill to absolutely brutal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No microtransactions</strong> – ever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of free cosmetics and outfits to unlock through gameplay and challenges</strong> (the fun kind that are just for looks and fun to try and unlock)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge system</strong> with exclusive cosmetic rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends, lock and load, and show these snacks why humanity doesn’t go down easy. The snackpocalypse ends here!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slipping into a junk food‑induced coma during a late‑night movie marathon, you wake up as an astronaut stranded in a galaxy overrun by living junk food! Play solo or co‑op online with up to 3 friends (4 players max) to battle hordes of junk food and Souls‑like bosses as you fight to escape alive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/58f88a42b0e4eb6e72b9c28d8086ad4b.webp?t=1787673383\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/2a0597607de33aea8fe8a8505aaf83c5.poster.avif?t=1787673383\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/2a0597607de33aea8fe8a8505aaf83c5.webm?t=1787673383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/2a0597607de33aea8fe8a8505aaf83c5.mp4?t=1787673383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192170/extras/9f7a06906b22d23e4ff0f68a4faf551c.webp?t=1787673383\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i